{"lemma":"אַבְרָהָם","translit":"av.ra.ham","gloss":"Abraham","tbesh_subentries":[],"tbesh_html":"A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.11.26; <br> son of: Terah (H8646); <br> brother of: Nahor (H5152H), Haran (H2039) and Sarah (H8283); married to Sarah (H8283), Hagar (H1904) and Keturah (H6989); <br> father of: Ishmael (H3458), Isaac (H3327), Zimran (H2175), Jokshan (H3370), Medan (H4091), Midian (H4080), Ishbak (H3435) and Shuah (H7744); also called Abram at Gen.11.26--17.5; 2x <BR> § Abraham = \"father of a multitude\" or \"chief of multitude\"<br> friend of God and founder of Hebrew nation via God's elective covenant<br>","tbesh_key":"H0085","strongs_1890":{"strongs_def":"Abraham, the later name of Abram","derivation":"contracted from H1 (אָב) and an unused root (probably meaning to be populous); father of a multitude;","kjv_def":"Abraham."},"count":175,"occurrences":[["Gen.17.5",1,null,null],["Gen.17.9",1,null,null],["Gen.17.15",1,null,null],["Gen.17.17",1,null,null],["Gen.17.18",1,null,null],["Gen.17.22",1,null,null],["Gen.17.23",2,null,null],["Gen.17.24",1,null,null],["Gen.17.26",1,null,null],["Gen.18.6",1,null,null],["Gen.18.7",1,null,null],["Gen.18.11",1,null,null],["Gen.18.13",1,null,null],["Gen.18.16",1,null,null],["Gen.18.17",1,null,null],["Gen.18.18",1,null,null],["Gen.18.19",1,null,null],["Gen.18.22",1,null,null],["Gen.18.23",1,null,null],["Gen.18.27",1,null,null],["Gen.18.33",2,null,null],["Gen.19.27",1,null,null],["Gen.19.29",1,null,null],["Gen.20.1",1,null,null],["Gen.20.2",1,null,null],["Gen.20.9",1,null,null],["Gen.20.10",1,null,null],["Gen.20.11",1,null,null],["Gen.20.14",1,null,null],["Gen.20.17",1,null,null],["Gen.20.18",1,null,null],["Gen.21.2",1,null,null],["Gen.21.3",1,null,null],["Gen.21.4",1,null,null],["Gen.21.5",1,null,null],["Gen.21.7",1,null,null],["Gen.21.8",1,null,null],["Gen.21.9",1,null,null],["Gen.21.10",1,null,null],["Gen.21.11",1,null,null],["Gen.21.12",1,null,null],["Gen.21.14",1,null,null],["Gen.21